  "description": "Distributed (Redis-capable) exchange-rate cache for Bodu.Financial. Provides DistributedRateCache, an IRateCache implementation over Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Distributed.IDistributedCache that persists a single provider's rates and fetch-coverage windows as a per-pair JSON blob, with the same freshness, merge, coverage, and validation semantics as the in-memory, TOML, and SQLite caches. Includes the dependency-injection registrations (AddDistributedRateCache, AddRedisRateCache) on IFinancialServiceBuilder.",
